Displays real-time counts of characters, spaces, words, and paragraphs while typing in the WordPress visual/text editor or custom textarea fields.

== Description ==
The [Count CWP WordPress Plugin](https://www.web357.com/product/count-words-characters-paragraphs-wordpress-plugin) enables real-time tracking of character, space, word, and paragraph counts while writing in posts, pages, or custom textarea fields. Ideal for authors, editors, and content managers who require precise text measurements.

== Video Description ==

[youtube https://youtu.be/13rTj-B3mhY]

== Basic Features ==
- Enable or disable character, space, word, or paragraph counts via `Settings > Count CWP`.
- Display counters directly below the WordPress editor or any custom textarea field.

== Installation ==
This plugin is simple to install:

1. Download the zip file `count-cwp.zip`.
2. Extract the contents.
3. Upload the `count-cwp` directory to `/wp-content/plugins/`.
4. Navigate to the Plugins page and activate the plugin.
5. Configure the settings via `Settings > Count CWP`.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Why should I use this plugin? =
This plugin is useful for writers, marketers, and editors who need to keep track of text limits for SEO, content planning, or ad copy creation.

